I have a start of a website for entering test questions (it just has a login 
page and a page for entering authors of questions), a database (it's in 
Postgres and I recently upgraded the OS, so I'll have to port the databases to 
the new version of Postgres), some example questions, and some, but not all, 
of the scales necessary for rating difficulty of questions. The mailing list is 
lojban-lbck@googlegroups.com ("lbck" stands for "lojbo bangu cipra kamni"). 
Here are some of the questions:

la .ka'irat. _____ la .misr.
a. rirxe
b. zbani
c. tcadu
d. snanu
e. xrabo

lo xabju be la .tiblis. cu _____
a. kartuli
b. kernauke
c. gombesa
d. sperlanu
e. nargile

lo xanto _____ lo nazbi cu clani
a. nai
b. zo'u
c. cu
d. co
e. bo'u

la .rampal. zgipli lo _____
a. sfani
b. drani
c. xrani
d. flani
e. zbani

There's also a reading comprehension passage, which I translated from Greek, 
with some questions.

